  "description": "Our SOUL FIRE 3 – designed by gravity experts for massive downhill fun! This bike features nothing but top-shelf components! Starting with high-quality suspension elements: The new Fox Float 38 GRIP2 is equipped at the front, while the RockShox VIVID COIL R2C shock is at the rear. For the brakes we’ve got the SRAM CODE RSC, which come with a 200 mm rotor at the front and a 180 mm disc rotor at the rear for high reliability and plenty of braking force. Perfect for steep trails and aggressive braking. The shifting system of the SOUL FIRE 3 – the SRAM X01 Eagle – was the first 12-speed derailleur system available on the market and is still one of the best. Here high shifting precision combines with a low weight. The hardware comes from the Canadian forge RaceFace: an Atlas handlebar (width 820 mm) and Turbine stem deliver high quality and a cool design. With this downhill machine, there are no more limits on how much fun you can have at bike parks! * approx. 15.9 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt black/yellow frame, size M, without pedals",
